msgid "Note: this tool doesn't apply the refraction correction for coordinates. Horizontal coordinates stop the clock, or the sky would turn away from the point while you arrive at it."
msgstr "Nota: custu toolu no ap applica sa curretxione de refratzione po sas coordinadas. Sas coordinadas orizontales fermant s'oraggiu, o su chelu si girada dae su punto mentre ca tu ti nde bas."

msgid "Notes: The quantity gamma is the minimum distance from the axis of lunar shadow cone to the center of Earth, in units of Earth’s equatorial radius. This distance is positive or negative, depending on whether the axis of the shadow cone passes north or south of the Earth's center. Path of solar eclipses during thousands of years in the past and future are not reliable due to uncertainty in ΔT which is caused by fluctuations in Earth's rotation."
msgstr "Notas: Sa cantidade gamma est sa distantzia minima dae s'assxi de conu de ombra lunare a su centru de sa Terra, in unitades de sa radius ecuatoriale de sa Terra. Custa distantzia est positiva o negativa, a seconda si s'assxi de conu de ombra calat dae norde o dae sud de su centru de sa Terra. Su caminu de sas eclisses solares durante migliaia de annos in su passau et su futuru no suni fidabiles comente incertidummene in ΔT chi est causada dae flutuatziones in sa rrotazione de sa Terra."

msgid "Notes: The quantity gamma is the minimum distance from the center of the Moon to the axis of Earth’s umbral shadow cone, in units of Earth’s equatorial radius. This distance is positive or negative, depending on whether the Moon passes north or south of the shadow cone axis. Local circumstances for eclipses during thousands of years in the past and future are not reliable due to uncertainty in ΔT which is caused by fluctuations in Earth's rotation."
msgstr "Notas: Sa cantidade gamma est sa distantzia minima dae su centru de sa Luna a s'assxi de conu de ombra umbreale de sa Terra, in unitades de sa radius ecuatoriale de sa Terra. Custa distantzia est positiva o negativa, a segunda si sa Luna calez dae norde o dae sud de s'assxi de conu de ombra. Sas circustantzias locales po sas eclisses durante migliaia de annos in su passau et su futuru no suni fidabiles comente incertidummene in ΔT chi est causada dae flutuatziones in sa rrotazione de sa Terra."

msgid "Notes: Time in parentheses means the contact is invisible at current location. Transit times during thousands of years in the past and future are not reliable due to uncertainty in ΔT which is caused by fluctuations in Earth's rotation."
msgstr "Notas: Su tempus in parentesi cheret niri chi su contattu est invisibile in sa logu currente. Sos tempus de transitu durante migliaia de annos in su passau et su futuru no suni fidabiles comente incertidummene in ΔT chi est causada dae flutuatziones in sa rrotazione de sa Terra."

